            "round_number": 1,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:40:32.092141+00:00",
            "notes": "You might want to focus on heals for the first two rounds. Your damage hasn't had a chance to ramp up yet, and your biotic energy isn't infinite yet by getting [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6).\n\nFor round 1, you don't have [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6), so you can't spam heal yet. Make sure you take the time to weave in some secondary fire here and there to keep your biotic energy filled\n\nRemember that, if you use your E to shoot a purple orb, that'll switch you over to \"Damage mode\" due to [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d), so you won't be able to do your burst heals through until you use E again to set yourself to \"Heal mode\". Be careful when choosing Purple Orbs until Round 2.",
