            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:40:32.092141+00:00",
            "notes": "You might want to focus on heals for the first two rounds. Your damage hasn't had a chance to ramp up yet, and your biotic energy isn't infinite yet by getting [Alternative Energy].\n\nBecause you now have [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6), you'll experience a power spike here where you can just literally glue your mouse's left-click down. You should only ever use Secondary Fire to secure kills. If you're not getting a kill, you should be keep spraying.\n\n PRO TIP: Don't actually glue your mouse down. Get a feel for when your left-click orbs will emit (unfortunately there is no UI element that signals where the Overload procs are), and play around the procs with intent. Tank need burst heals? Switch to heal and then emit a double orb. Switching back to purple? Slam a choke with a couple of pain orbs.",
